eed. Other updates:Polished shop and Journal scrollbar styling, width, and positioning.Updated Cozy rating calculations to reflect milestone and garden-category progress.Improved fullscreen resolution detection and monitor-specif","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T16:51:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951307946","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3946460-1840944183785157","game_id":"steam-3946460","kind":"update","title":"Shroomy Garden Demo Patch 🍄🌿","summary":"A small patch for the Shroomy Garden Demo is now live, mainly focused on bug fixes, balancing, and a few quality-of-life improvements. Fixes & Improvements⚖️ Improved game balancing for a smoother demo experience.🛠️ Fixed an issue causing colored fences to become misaligned.🎮 Fixed a controller issue during the tutorial.🎯 Adjusted the demo objective to make it simpler and clearer to complete.✅ Added a clearer end point when the demo objective is completed.🖥️ Changed the default resolution to 128","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T05:13:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785157","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3946460-1840944183773659","game_id":"steam-3946460","kind":"announcement","title":"Shroomy Garden Demo Is Live! 🍄🌿","summary":"Hi everyone!I’m really excited to share that the Shroomy Garden demo is now available to play on Steam!This demo gives you a first look at the core gameplay and lets you start building your own cozy little theme park.You can place attractions, decorate different areas, experiment with layouts, and slowly turn an empty space into a garden that feels completely your own.(Gif from the full game)I’m still actively polishing and improving Shroomy Garden, so I’d genuinely love to hear what you think a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T10:54:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183773659","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3946460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:03:15Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:03:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3946460":"2026-10-26T11:03:15Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3946460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:03:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:03:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:03:15Z"},"4738280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:03:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:03:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:03:15Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3946460","app_id":3946460,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:24Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"dcf58d0864c519121ee095b4e8a7c6917eb2bcd3c1a2c82823fd40cc278f8a57","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"놀이기구와 워터 슬라이드, 아기자기한 장식으로 가득한 테마파크나 워터파크를 만들어 보세요. 사랑스러운 Shroomies들이 찾아와 당신의 공간에 생기를 더합니다. 자유롭게 꾸미며 나만의 작은 휴식처를 만드는 편안한 게임입니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Magicwood Labs","creator_clan_account_id":45923760}],"developers":[{"name":"Magicwood Labs","creator_clan_account_id":45923760}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1794405600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Shroomy Garden (Official Tr